{"created_at": "2026-11-16", "note": "書誌と第三者要約で照合。擬人観を禁止から検査手続きへ変換する章として読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261116-708935", "reading": "summarized", "recorded_by_session_id": "SESSION-20261116-41c924", "session_id": "SESSION-20261116-41c924", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261116-a71892", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-16", "note": "出版社紹介の一文を照合。語彙が主体を空の対象へ変えるという主張を確認した。", "read_id": "READ-20261116-f4e1d5", "reading": "quoted", "recorded_by_session_id": "SESSION-20261116-41c924", "session_id": "SESSION-20261116-41c924", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261116-e5fbca", "type": "material"}}
